Speaches Cloudron package: third-party notices
================================================

Application
-----------
Speaches is developed by Fedir Zadniprovskyi and contributors, and is
distributed under the MIT licence. See LICENSE for the full text. This
package builds a Cloudron-compatible image around the unmodified upstream
application and adds only the Cloudron integration layer (manifest, start
script, and reverse proxy configuration).

logo.png
--------
Source: the GitHub organisation avatar of speaches-ai
(https://github.com/speaches-ai), retrieved 2026-07-30. An archived copy of
the original avatar is kept in the maintainer's private working notes, not
in this repository.

Upstream has no separately authored application logo or icon. The
organisation avatar is the only project-specific visual mark available.
logo.png is a proportional resize of that avatar to the packaging icon
size, with no recolouring, redrawing, or other modification.
